{
  "//": [
    "Q15 — Insert a purchase",
    "What it answers: Inserts one purchase (three commands: next id, copy fields in, insert) and returns the new row with status 201. If MongoDB refuses the write (a conflict, a missing card or product), it returns 503.",
    "Route:           POST /purchases   (params: JSON body; every route also takes db=)",
    "Pattern:         — (see 08_concurrency/)",
    "Engine:          MongoDB",
    "Think about it:",
    "An insert here is three commands (see 'steps'). What does each one do? Which",
    "one makes every concurrent writer touch the same document? And what happens",
    "to the copied-in state_code and card_type if the customer moves later?"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "name": "next_id",
      "command": {
        "findAndModify": "counters",
        "query": {
          "_id": "purchase_id"
        },
        "update": {
          "$inc": {
            "seq": 1
          }
        },
        "new": true
      },
      "take": {
        "purchase_id": "value.seq"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "copy_in",
      "command": {
        "aggregate": "customers",
        "cursor": {},
        "pipeline": [
          {
            "$match": {
              "_id": "{{customer_id}}"
            }
          },
          {
            "$unwind": "$cards"
          },
          {
            "$match": {
              "cards.card_id": "{{card_id}}"
            }
          },
          {
            "$lookup": {
              "from": "products",
              "pipeline": [
                {
                  "$match": {
                    "_id": "{{product_id}}"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "as": "p"
            }
          },
          {
            "$unwind": "$p"
          },
          {
            "$project": {
              "_id": 0,
              "state_code": 1,
              "card_type": "$cards.card_type",
              "product_name": "$p.product_name"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "take": {
        "state_code": "0.state_code",
        "card_type": "0.card_type",
        "product_name": "0.product_name"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "insert",
      "command": {
        "insert": "purchases",
        "documents": [
          {
            "_id": "{{purchase_id}}",
            "customer_id": "{{customer_id}}",
            "card_id": "{{card_id}}",
            "product_id": "{{product_id}}",
            "department": "{{department}}",
            "amount": "{{amount:decimal}}",
            "purchase_date": "{{purchase_date:date}}",
            "product_name": "{{product_name}}",
            "state_code": "{{state_code}}",
            "card_type": "{{card_type}}"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "returning": [
    "purchase_id",
    "customer_id",
    "product_id",
    "department",
    "amount",
    "purchase_date"
  ]
}
